## PENDING MEMORY STATE MACHINE

Use an explicit state machine.

DRAFT
↓
EXTRACTED
↓
PENDING_CONFIRMATION
↓
USER_CONFIRMED
↓
STORED

Alternative paths:

PENDING_CONFIRMATION
↓
USER_REJECTED
↓
DISCARDED

PENDING_CONFIRMATION
↓
USER_EDITED
↓
UPDATED_CANDIDATE
↓
PENDING_CONFIRMATION

Do not allow:

PENDING_CONFIRMATION
↓
Run extraction on "yes"

This is the current bug and must be prevented.

