## FINAL RULE

"YES" IS A CONTROL ACTION, NOT INSTITUTIONAL KNOWLEDGE.

When there is an active pending memory confirmation:

YES = SAVE THE PENDING MEMORY

NO = DISCARD THE PENDING MEMORY

EDIT = MODIFY THE PENDING MEMORY

Only run normal memory extraction when there is no pending confirmation context.
